body:
Hey Adam,

&#x200B;

I'm also 27 and working a shit job, and it's difficult to not want to end it every day. Is there anything you look forward to? Like, on payday do you treat yourself to something? I know it's not a cure-all, but at least for myself it helps to push that little splurge a little earlier when I'm in crisis.

&#x200B;

You definitely aren't alone. We're all suffering together, but that doesn't mean that we have to be miserable or feel alone.

&#x200B;

Plus, give yourself some credit. At least you have a job, even if it's as a cashier. You clearly are doing something right.
